ws alongside soft yet structurally defined highlights.\nEnsure all lighting adheres strictly to physical logic, originating exclusively from existing or logically inferable sources within the scene. Do not introduce unrelated light sources.\nStrictly avoid: foggy gray washes, crushed/dead blacks, excessive bloom, artificial HDR looks, over-sharpening, or fake lens flares.\nMatch the reference image’s subject features, composition, camera position, light ratio, and overall color tone, while shifting toward a darker, mood-driven cinematic lighting style with subtle atmosphere and refined optical softening.\nStrictly prohibit adding any watermarks, logos, subtitles, UI elements, borders, QR codes, signatures, or extraneous text."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-1748.624755859375, 787.3587036132812], "id": 186, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.26.13", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [613.8083172905683, -170.54398036709867], "scale": 0.9646149645000096}}, "groups": [{"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 80, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "👉用我的邀请码注册送1000RH币👉邀请码：3qo65owt", "bounding": [-1751.7877197265625, -208.48439025878906, 2058.783447265625, 110.99109649658203]}, {"color": "#b58b2a", "font_size": 120, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "FireRed-Image-Edit 1.1-[人像] 原生肌理·去AI·去塑料-电影感-高清直出", "bounding": [-1759.1593017578125, -59.51288986206055, 3801.16748046875, 169.56576538085938]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 50, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "FireRed-Image-Edit 1.1", "bounding": [-1305.450927734375, 163.33908081054688, 1677.135498046875, 826.0